# Requests for the Stage 1 server (npm run stage1).
# VS Code: install the "REST Client" extension, then click "Send Request" above each block.
# Each request is separated by ###

@base = http://localhost:3000

### Health check
GET {{base}}/health

### Echo — valid
POST {{base}}/echo
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "hello" }

### Echo — missing message (expect 400)
POST {{base}}/echo
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Echo — no Content-Type header. What does req.body look like now?
POST {{base}}/echo

{ "message": "hello" }

### Unknown route (expect 404)
GET {{base}}/nope


### GET /time (default ISO)
GET {{base}}/time

### GET /time as a unix timestamp
GET {{base}}/time?format=unix

### GET /time with an unknown format (expect 400)
GET {{base}}/time?format=xyz
